From 8634e6bd8164368004ad6bd01959b3118fcd58dd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LGNative <luis@nativestride.io>
Date: Sun, 21 Jun 2026 18:14:59 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 19/30] TR Importer: English UI, 2-tab simplification, Start
 over, v3.5.2
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Translate the whole addon UI to English to match the base app (the PT/EN mix
  was confusing). Logic strings, currency/provider codes and identifiers
  untouched.
- Collapse to 2 tabs (Import + Analysis): remove the Advanced tab (AI expert +
  SDK test) the user didn't use, and delete the now-dead expert-panel.tsx,
  tr-ai-expert.ts, tr-sdk-test.ts. Diagnostics stay in Analysis.
- Add a 'Start over' button so the user can return to the drop zone mid-import
  without leaving the app.
- Review Assets redesign: urgency-grouped sections, currency badges
  (USD → EUR), per-asset density, pre-import type breakdown.
- manifest: version 5.3.2 → 3.5.2 (match the app), shorter description.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
